Strong recommendation that Amazon stop using EMS!
Five stars for goods, one star for logistics, average three stars.
Why Amazon would send EMS? It’s not credible, right? After all, computers are also valuable items!
After the purchase, the order was expected to arrive on 20, so the family waited at home for three days!
Why do you need four or five days to send it from Xiamen to Fuzhou?
On the morning of 22nd, I checked the logistics and finally arrived in Fuzhou, ready to open my heart and accept the goods. As a result, in the evening, without receiving any phone calls or text messages, I checked the logistics and the goods were signed at noon, and I even showed my signature!
I was stunned!
Who am I? Where am I? Did I really buy this computer?
I'm starting to doubt the existence of life itself!
Finally, I brought the computer back after running errands at a drop-off point.
The specific reason is simple, because the express delivery guy mixed up the two numbers, but fortunately, the package was not lost.
I strongly recommend that Amazon stop using EMS; I will definitely not buy their packages if they use EMS again in the future.
