I don't understand this logic. I am a Japanese person, I need a Chinese customer service, and I am living in Japan, so I don't need a Chinese customer service. The tourists who go to Japan don't have the time to call international long distance, so the question is, who needs to call the Amazon international shopping Chinese customer service? It is not the people like me who shop in Japan.
