The product is good, but Amazon's after-sales service is really worse than other websites
After placing the order, I discovered that the order was wrong, but I could not cancel it, and the web page contacting online customer service was always showing the wrong link, and I could not contact it.
After delivery, the delivery person called me and said I didn't want it anymore; I wanted to cancel the order but it wasn't successful. The delivery person took it back and said they would sign for it first so that I could apply for a return.
When I applied for return, I was told that food items cannot be returned once they are signed for. I could not call Amazon customer service, and they said the same thing.
I have bought non-returnable items on JD.com and Suning before, including milk and diapers, and contacted the customer service to get them returned. The diapers opened after they were delivered smelled too bad, but the customer service still gave me a refund. On Amazon, you can't get a refund for non-returnable items.
The rules are dead, people are alive, how should we handle this? Contact our customer service department.
Tell me, either I pick it up myself or I let the courier buy it, and it's not easy for the courier to do that, so why do I have the courier pay for something I don't buy?
Okay, I'm not withdrawing either. I collected it myself, but I have to give you a point for your service.
Headphone distortion, and noise
This earphone is really trash, I don't know if it's my ears that are the problem or if the earphone is really not as good as it used to be.
I bought a blue one two years ago at a local store, sound quality was good, no noise, bass was good, after two years of use it broke, I'm going to buy another one (urbeats), after all, it feels good.
I bought a purple one, which is quite good looking, but when I opened it today, I found that the sound was not right. The sound was either too loud or too soft.
I thought it was just the sound effects of that song and didn't give much thought to it at first, but after listening for hours I realized this problem was quite serious. Not only were there off-key notes, but also poor bass quality compared to what I had heard before. There were some additional noises, is it possible that only my purple headphones have this issue? Or could it be that the headphone manufacturing process has indeed fallen short?
It was a very disappointing evaluation.
Make sure to return it tomorrow during the day.
PS looks good
Amazon should not sell this kind of product
I bought it at a discounted price, and the price is not low. The comments are also very good.
When I actually received the product, I was shocked. The product was scratched all over, and there were scratches on other parts of the product. It was not a defective product or a second-hand product. I will post a picture later.
I applied for a return, and the factory said that it was the transportation that caused it, is this not nonsense?
How can wear occur inside a product?
There are only two possibilities: either it is a defective or a used product, or I deliberately damaged the product and then returned it.
Objectively, I have no evidence that I did not damage the goods, but in terms of my credit history of shopping on Amazon, I think that such goods should not appear in Amazon's own products, the customer chooses Amazon's own products is trust, customer win, we win, the victory of the customer is the victory of the manufacturer, hope you all work together to improve, thank you.
Very satisfied with the watch.
It is definitely genuine; I have checked it at the boutique and the watch looks very nice in appearance with fine workmanship. The materials used are sufficient, and as it has an imported mechanical movement, it carries some weight. It cannot be compared to those so-called mechanical watches priced around 300 yuan. This is authentic merchandise.
The watch is accurate and within acceptable error limits; it comes with a jewelry appraisal certificate inside the box, and the 12-word mark on the dial is genuine diamond. It fits well for personal use, and as a gift, it adds to one's prestige.
The Bentley watch is really good.
